        Root cause:
        The bug was likely caused by the filter processing tasks even when the filter was already in process, which could lead to unexpected behavior or conflicts in task execution. The code changes enforce checks to ensure tasks are only processed when the filter is not already in process and there are tasks available, preventing simultaneous processing issues.

        Commit message:
